title: 엔딩50_신아산_영문
---
<<bg 낮_강의실>>
{name()}: ...And that concludes my presentation. Thank you.
<<play 공통_박수>>
<<show san_shock>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Whoa, didn't you say you pulled an all-nighter preparing for this major presentation?
ASan: You actually did a pretty decent job for someone who hasn't slept.
{name()}: Well, I have to avoid retaking this mandatory major at all costs.
{name()}: I seriously never want to see that professor again—not even in my dreams.
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Should I go tell him you said that?
{name()}: ..Please, anything but that..
<<show san_idle>>
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: Anyway, you. I've got a job for you. Let's work on something together.
{name()}: A job? What kind of job?
ASan: Just follow me.
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
(The place ASan led me to was none other than the club room.)
{name()}: What’s all this?
ASan: The draft for my Summer Break Game Dev Project.
{name()}: Wait, what?
ASan: Exactly what I said.
<<show san_blush>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: The goal is to finish one game within a year, and the final step is...
ASan: Submitting it to the NDM exhibition!!!!!!
{name()}: Excuse me???????
{name()}: Why are you telling ME this...
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: After observing you all semester, I've concluded that you're actually quite useful if someone teaches you right.
ASan: Plus, you were a smooth talker during that presentation earlier.
ASan: So, in other words, I'm "scouting" you.
{name()}: Ha... ha... ha... ha.....
{name()}: SorrybutI'mactuallyreallybusythissummerbreaksoI'lljustbeleavingnow—
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Where do you think you're going?!!!!!!!!!
ASan: Once you're in, there's no way out.
ASan: You know our team's award history, right?
{name()}: Yes, ma'am....
<<if get_fuck() > 0>>
    ASan: Even though you're a person with the personality to flip me off {get_fuck()} times, I'm S-P-E-C-I-A-L-L-Y letting you join.
<<endif>>
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: So, it's a deal, right?
{name()}: ..... Yes.....
ASan: Welcome to my project.
<<hide>>
<<bg 신아산_일반엔딩>>
(And so, I spent the next half a month practically kidnapped by ASan, training hard under her leadership.)
(Thanks to her, I've reached a point where I know everything there is to know about Object-Oriented Programming—and game dev too.)
(Oh! And the most important part! We actually got great results at the NDM.)
(It looks like I'll probably be forced into doing my graduation project with her as well....)
(But hey, aren't we a pretty good duo?)
(I feel like as long as we're together, there's nothing we can't do.)
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===